# Environment
# This repo is public. EVERY env file is ignored, at any depth and whatever
# its suffix (.env, .env2, .env.bak, deploy/.env.ci-test, ...); only the
# documented examples are tracked. Keep the negations AFTER the ignores.
.env
.env*
**/.env*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
# Editor/sed backups of the above (scripts/reauth-v2.sh makes a deploy/.env.bak).
*.bak
# Operator-only notes that must never be published.
docs/private/
*.local
serviceAccountKey.json
lavalink/tokens.json
*.egg-info/
*.egg-info/
deploy/firebase-service-account.json
firebase-service-account*.json
